  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.40\n\nReleased on 2026-09-14.\n\nSandboxed compositions no longer lose audio while the timeline and visuals keep playing.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Core:** Web Audio routing now checks the document’s security origin with `window.origin`. Media without `crossorigin` stays out of Web Audio when that origin is opaque, even if the URL origins match ([293829a2c](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/293829a2c1bde0707548b230b74b5cdf8e8985f2), [#3937](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/3937)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.39...v0.8.40\n",
